Date: Sat, 28 Nov 2026 01:03:09 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 60/64] iio: adc: S2MPS25 GPADC through ACPM; b0s
 battery/charger/USB thermistors

ACPM channel 11 reads the PMIC's ADC (8-byte messages, cmd[1] = channel,
reply = 12-bit result). generic-adc-thermal zones with Samsung's tables.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
